(140: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%23%20Context%0A%0A%60konard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%60%20recently%20shipped%20%5BPR%20%2352%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fpull%2F52%29%20%28closes%20%5Bissue%20%2351%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fissues%2F51%29%29%20which%20adds%20a%20release-time%20pipeline%20that%20auto-regenerates%20every%20preview%20image%20%28README%20%2B%20Pages%20site%20%2B%20%60og%3Aimage%60%29%20using%20%5B%60browser-commander%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fwww.npmjs.com%2Fpackage%2Fbrowser-commander%29%20%2B%20Playwright%2C%20then%20commits%20the%20drift%20back%20to%20%60main%60.%0A%0AWhile%20auditing%20CI%20parity%20I%20checked%20the%20four%20%60link-foundation%60%20AI-driven-development-pipeline-template%20repos%20and%20%2A%2Anone%2A%2A%20ship%20browser%20automation%20or%20screenshot%20tooling.%20Full%20per-template%20survey%3A%20%5B%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-51%2Fdata%2Ftemplates%2Fsurvey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fblob%2Fissue-51-60ec0489f01f%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-51%2Fdata%2Ftemplates%2Fsurvey.md%29.%0A%0ASince%20this%20template%20already%20has%20%60.github%2Fworkflows%2Fexample-app.yml%60%20and%20the%20richest%20%60scripts%2F%60%20ecosystem%20of%20the%20four%2C%20it%27s%20the%20natural%20primary%20host%20for%20the%20pattern.%0A%0A%23%23%20Problem%0A%0AAny%20example%20app%20shipped%20from%20this%20template%20will%20accumulate%20stale%20README%2Fsite%20screenshots%20between%20releases.%20There%20is%20no%20automation%20that%3A%0A%0A1.%20Boots%20the%20example%20app%20%28or%20its%20built%20site%29%20in%20a%20real%20browser%20headlessly.%0A2.%20Captures%20fresh%20screenshots%20across%20the%20locale%20%C3%97%20theme%20matrix.%0A3.%20Commits%20drift%20back%20to%20%60main%60%20%28or%20surfaces%20it%20on%20PRs%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Reproducible%20recipe%0A%0AThe%20full%20implementation%20lives%20at%20%5B%60scripts%2Fupdate-preview-images.mjs%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fblob%2Fissue-51-60ec0489f01f%2Fscripts%2Fupdate-preview-images.mjs%29%20and%20%5Bthe%20%60preview-regen%60%20job%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fblob%2Fissue-51-60ec0489f01f%2F.github%2Fworkflows%2Fjs.yml%23L657%29%20in%20%60vk-bot-desktop%60.%20Key%20building%20blocks%20worth%20pulling%20upstream%3A%0A%0A-%20Static%20HTTP%20server%20over%20the%20renderer%20dist%20%28no%20Electron%20%2F%20no%20devserver%20needed%20for%20capture%29.%0A-%20%60browser.newContext%28%7B%20locale%20%7D%29%60%20to%20drive%20locale%20%28no%20in-UI%20segmented-control%20toggling%29.%0A-%20%60commander.emulateMedia%28%7B%20colorScheme%20%7D%29%60%20%2B%20%60localStorage%60%20to%20drive%20theme.%0A-%20%60commander.page.screenshot%28%29%60%20because%20%60browser-commander%400.8%60%20exposes%20the%20raw%20Playwright%20page%20%28no%20native%20screenshot%20method%20as%20of%200.10.1%29.%0A-%20%60git%20status%20--porcelain%60%20drift%20detection%20%2B%20%60git%20commit%20-m%20%22...%20%5Bskip%20ci%5D%22%60%20push-back%2C%20so%20the%20loop%20is%20self-healing%20without%20an%20extra%20workflow.%0A-%20%60PREVIEW_VERBOSE%3D1%60%20to%20dump%20DOM%20probes%20%28data-theme%2C%20lang%2C%20h1%20contents%29%20so%20CI%20failures%20are%20diagnosable%20from%20logs%20alone.%0A%0A%23%23%20Suggested%20fix%0A%0AAdd%20a%20%60preview-regen%60%20job%20to%20%60example-app.yml%60%20that%3A%0A%0A1.%20Runs%20on%20push%20to%20%60main%60%2C%20on%20release%20tag%20pushes%2C%20and%20on%20%60workflow_dispatch%60.%0A2.%20Installs%20the%20existing%20%60browser-commander%60%20%2B%20%60playwright%60%20pin%20already%20used%20elsewhere.%0A3.%20Drives%20the%20example%20app%27s%20site%20through%20a%20locale%20%C3%97%20theme%20matrix.%0A4.%20Commits%20any%20drift%20to%20%60main%60%20with%20%60%5Bskip%20ci%5D%60%2C%20or%20surfaces%20a%20workflow%20artifact%20on%20PRs.%0A%0AHappy%20to%20send%20a%20PR%20if%20you%27d%20like.%0A%0A%23%23%20Related%0A%0A-%20konard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2351%20%E2%80%94%20original%20issue%0A-%20konard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2352%20%E2%80%94%20implementation%20PR%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
